{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Prime Agent has been installed successfully.

Quick Start:
  - Launch interactive terminal interface:
      $ prime-agent

  - Inspect background daemon status:
      $ prime-agent doctor

Optional packages to enhance Python skills and data processing:
  - Data Science & Numerical Analysis:
      $ pkg install %%PYTHON_PKGNAMEPREFIX%%numpy %%PYTHON_PKGNAMEPREFIX%%pandas %%PYTHON_PKGNAMEPREFIX%%scipy

  - Charting & Visualizations:
      $ pkg install %%PYTHON_PKGNAMEPREFIX%%matplotlib

  - Data Validation & Environment:
      $ pkg install %%PYTHON_PKGNAMEPREFIX%%lxml %%PYTHON_PKGNAMEPREFIX%%pydantic2 %%PYTHON_PKGNAMEPREFIX%%python-dotenv

  - Web Search & Integrations:
      $ pkg install %%PYTHON_PKGNAMEPREFIX%%ddgs %%PYTHON_PKGNAMEPREFIX%%PyGithub

  - System Clipboard Support (X11 / Wayland):
      $ pkg install xclip        # For X11
      $ pkg install wl-clipboard  # For Wayland

All 13 built-in skills, Node.js CLI, and Python kernel runtime
are installed and pre-configured out-of-the-box.

Documentation:
  https://github.com/PrimeIntellect-ai/prime-agent
EOM
}
